ONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">유학생들의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">한국문화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">체험</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">및</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">한국</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">사회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">구성원들과의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">교류</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">기회를</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">제공하는</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">외국인<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;</span>유학생<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;</span>한국문화탐방단<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;</span>‘아우르기’</span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\">를<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;다음과 같이 모집하오니 관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여 부탁드립니다.</span></span></p><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">1. 모집대상</span></strong><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp; - 국내 대학(원) 재학 중인 </span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 외국인 유학생(단원) 100명, 한국인 대학생(서포터즈) 20명 </span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ YouTube 등 콘텐츠 크리에이터 경험자 우대</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 1~4기 단원은 지원 불가</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">2. 활동내용</span></strong><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp; - 2019년 5~11월 중, 월 1~4회의 한국 및 세계문화탐방 활동 진행</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">3. 선발혜택</span></strong><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp; - 탐방 활동 비용 전액 지원</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp; - 프로그램을 성실히 참여한 단원, 수료증 수여</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp; - 최우수, 우수 단원으로 선정 시, 상장 및 상품 수여</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">4. 선발일정</span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\"> </span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp; - 지원서 접수: 3월 29일(금) 24:00까지 </span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 지원서 지정양식, 이메일(</span><a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">outlookie@kofice.or.kr</span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">) 제출</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp; - 서류합격자 발표: 4월 5일(금)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp; - 면접: 4월 10일(수)~12일(금) 중 진행</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">&nbsp; - 최종합격자 발표: 4월 15일(월) </span></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">5. 문의처</span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">: </span><a href=\"mailto:outlookie@kofice.or.kr\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움, Dotum\">outlookie@kofice.or.kr</span></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"http://www.kofice.or.kr/\" target=\"new\">www.kofice.or.kr</a> </span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
